Spec 17 Part G: windows, clicks and the DIB driver. G1: a shared window object whose id reads 0
fails with STATUS_INVALID_HANDLE (window.c, spec 12 B8's rule for windows). G2: GetAncestor
GA_ROOT walks up with GA_PARENT while WS_CHILD when the parent list can't be read
(w32ios_s17_root_walk). G3: a button-down whose top window can't be activated is delivered
(message.c). G4: NtUserActivateKeyboardLayout's unsupported flags are logged once (input.c).
G5: the source-bits hook only for a visible rectangle of at least 640 x 400, weak (replaces
spec 12's unconditional call in dibdrv/bitblt.c). Applied after spec 12's patches.

